1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,360
NFTs are art.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,293
Or are they?

3
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:06,914
This is how they get sold.

4
00:00:07,592 --> 00:00:10,059
Thousands of buyers. One button.

5
00:00:10,125 --> 00:00:11,093
Gas spikes.

6
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,335
The site crashes.

7
00:00:12,375 --> 00:00:13,819
Transactions fail…

8
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:15,510
and you still pay the fees.

9
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:17,635
While you're still refreshing…

10
00:00:17,675 --> 00:00:19,269
the bots are already done.

11
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,593
Bots don't wait in line.

12
00:00:21,633 --> 00:00:23,070
They take the whole drop…

13
00:00:23,242 --> 00:00:24,757
and sell it back to you.

14
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:26,852
Welcome to the mint race.

15
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:29,949
But art was never sold like this.

16
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:31,260
AUCTIONEER: One thousand.

17
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,110
AUCTIONEER: One thousand and one.

18
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,607
AUCTIONEER: Two thousand.

19
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,318
BIDDER: Ten thousand!

20
00:00:37,358 --> 00:00:40,068
BIDDER: Ten thousand… and one.

21
00:00:40,108 --> 00:00:41,104
AUCTIONEER: Sold.

22
00:00:42,383 --> 00:00:44,561
NEIGHBOUR: Cheeky boy.

23
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:47,049
At Cloak, we take it one step further.

24
00:00:50,325 --> 00:00:51,983
Every bid is sealed.

25
00:00:52,075 --> 00:00:53,880
Nobody sees anyone else's.

26
00:00:54,883 --> 00:00:56,376
Not the other bidders.

27
00:00:56,483 --> 00:00:57,643
Not the bots.

28
00:00:57,683 --> 00:00:58,917
Not even us.

29
00:00:59,483 --> 00:01:02,543
When bidding closes, every bid opens at once.

30
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:04,112
The highest bids win.

31
00:01:04,383 --> 00:01:06,705
And every winner pays the same price.

32
00:01:12,175 --> 00:01:15,843
NFT sealed drops. Live on Cloak.
